nture!</strong></p>","developers":["Yoann AMAR ASSOULINE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585280/cdc7fe2fcb2a666ec072cf29058954de7cfc1c40/header.jpg?t=1764533781","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game was developed by Yoann AMAR ASSOULINE in Paris, France, and is made and owned by Goldanniyatech. Goldanniyatech is an independent, single-developer studio operated by Yoann AMAR ASSOULINE.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Goldanniyatech","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-12600K or AMD Ryzen 5 7600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia RTX 3060 or AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required. System specifications are subject to change as development progresses.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700K or AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia RTX 4070 or AMD RX 7900 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Required</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Goldanniyatech"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"releas